sms.body:
Dakhla Sahayak: your income certificate application {number} needs the following.
{items}
Please contact the Tehsil Office, Mulshi.

ai.panchnama:
A visit was made on {visitDate} to Mouje {village}, Taluka Mulshi, District Pune, and enquiries were held. The applicant {applicantName} {residence, select, confirmed {was found to be living in the said village permanently} other {was found not to be living in the said village}}. The family has {familyMembers} members in all. Sources of income: {incomeSources}. Property: {assets}. The application declares an annual income of {declaredIncome}; from the above enquiries the total annual income of the family is found to be {verifiedIncome}. This panchnama was drawn up before the panch witnesses {panchNames}.

{talathiName}
Talathi, Saja {village}

order.approve:
The income certificate application of {applicantName}, resident of {village}, Taluka Mulshi, District Pune, is approved. From the document scrutiny and the Talathi's field verification report, the total annual income of the applicant's family ({familyMembers} members) is found to be {certifiedIncome}. Certificate number {certificateNumber} is accordingly issued on {decisionDate}.

{officerName}
Naib Tehsildar, Mulshi

order.reject:
The income certificate application of {applicantName}, resident of {village}, Taluka Mulshi, District Pune, is rejected. According to the Talathi's field verification report, residence at the stated address is not established. A certificate therefore cannot be issued from the jurisdiction of this office. The applicant may appeal against this order to the superior office.

{officerName}
Naib Tehsildar, Mulshi

order.return:
The application of {applicantName}, resident of {village}, Taluka Mulshi, District Pune, is returned for compliance. The field verification found the total annual income of the family to be {certifiedIncome}, which is {gapPercent} above the {declaredIncome} declared in the application. The application will be taken further once the applicant files a revised self-declaration in the prescribed form.

{officerName}
Naib Tehsildar, Mulshi
